. * GENERATE VARIABLES * 
. 
.         * Outcome: Left-leaning political preference
.         
.         // We generate a dummy variable for left-leaning based on the general
>  party preference
.         recode plh0012_h (1 5 6 9 =1 "left-leaning") ( 2 3 4 7 27 26 =0 "not 
> left-leaning") (-5/-1 2/30=.) ,gen(left)
(449,900 differences between plh0012_h and left)

.         replace left = 0 if plh0011_h ==2
(270,490 real changes made)

.         lab var left "Dummy: Left-leaning political preference based on gener
> al party preference"

. 
